{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/60752c62aaaec7e0a8ad05356a2a3b2c.avif?t=1768965362\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheltered from the Storm</strong> is a calm, atmospheric experience set in a quiet world touched by danger but defined by stillness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players move between various shelters \u2014 from a parked <strong>campervan</strong>, a lonely forest camp, or an abandoned house, to an underground <strong>banker</strong> bunker where the sound of rain echoes softly. Each location offers a unique mood and ambient soundscape, designed to help players relax, reflect, or simply listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In various scenes, you\u2019ll encounter NPCs who belong to this world. Each character has their own daily tasks, unique personality, and background to discover. Through quiet dialogue, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of the story. Their reactions shift depending on the weather, time of day, and ongoing events, bringing subtle life to a fading world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battles to fight, no objectives to chase \u2014 only moments to exist within. You'll sit in the dark as rain taps on rooftops, thunder rumbles in the distance, and faint growls of walkers remind you the world outside is no longer safe. The beauty lies in the quiet, in finding comfort despite the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/a0eca8e279f8d2b5fa5f432e35df9b8e.poster.avif?t=1768965362\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/a0eca8e279f8d2b5fa5f432e35df9b8e.webm?t=1768965362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/a0eca8e279f8d2b5fa5f432e35df9b8e.mp4?t=1768965362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather System:</strong> rain, fog, overcast skies, sandstorms, and more \u2014 each affecting the mood and visibility of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Shelters:</strong> a campervan, forest camps, houses, and an underground banker \u2014 each with its own distinct soundscape and feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambient NPC Interaction:</strong> talk to characters with daily routines, changing moods, and story fragments based on weather or time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Ambience:</strong> immersive audio featuring rain, thunder, wind, and distant walkers, layered with subtle ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> experience a world through sound, conversation, and setting \u2014 no combat or survival meters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal Interaction:</strong> focus is on immersion, reflection, and the emotional weight of stillness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/d78ae14ac3f191bc6388900ed447bd78.poster.avif?t=1768965362\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/d78ae14ac3f191bc6388900ed447bd78.webm?t=1768965362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/d78ae14ac3f191bc6388900ed447bd78.mp4?t=1768965362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheltered from the Storm</strong> is not a survival game. It\u2019s a quiet space to exist \u2014 a slow, emotional moment inside a fragile world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3251940?t=1768965362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3251940?t=1768965362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/24242ff239a6c8b817e9bece609b7260c574590f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768965362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/24242ff239a6c8b817e9bece609b7260c574590f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768965362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251940/extras/60752c62aaaec7e0a8ad05356a2a3b2c.avif?t=1768965362\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheltered from the Storm</strong> is a calm, atmospheric experience set in a quiet world touched by danger but defined by stillness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players move between various shelters \u2014 from a parked <strong>campervan</strong>, a lonely forest camp, or an abandoned house, to an underground <strong>banker</strong> bunker where the sound of rain echoes softly. Each location offers a unique mood and ambient soundscape, designed to help players relax, reflect, or simply listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In various scenes, you\u2019ll encounter NPCs who belong to this world. Each character has their own daily tasks, unique personality, and background to discover. Through quiet dialogue